  "about": {
    "description": "wMUx is the ERC-4626 wrapped version of MUx (Micron Technology xStock). It wraps MUx into a standardized vault-share token to enable DeFi composability such as use as collateral in lending markets, automated strategies, and other yield protocols. Each wMUx represents a share claim on deposited MUx. Underlying real-world exposure, redemption mechanics, and reference price tracking are inherited from the underlying MUx xStock issued by Backed. The wrapper does not rebase, so its share-to-underlying ratio grows with the xStocks multiplier, making it a total-return tracker rather than a price-parity tracker.",
